    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "some of those sound a bit like NIMBY talking though. i'm trying to figure out which ones are actually based on real planning data and which ones are just people being difficult or trying to block progress. can you tell me which of these criticisms are considered legitimate urban planning concerns versus just being reactionary?",
